# Razor Nahida Fischl Zhongli. ~22s Rotation. Razor Hybrid Aggravate. ATK > EM Sands. ATK & Electro Goblet are very similar. ZL picks up Electro Crystalize Shard for AP.

# Team- Options listsed by DPS
razor char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
razor add weapon="serpentspine" refine=1 lvl=90/90 +params=[stacks=5];
razor add set="pf" count=4;
